    "content" : "Another method for increasing computational Speed is “speculative eXecution' in which a processor executes mul tiple branch paths simultaneously, or predicts a branch, So that the processor can continue executing without waiting for the result of the branch operation. By reducing depen dencies on branch conditions, Speculative execution can"
